    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Techniques\" title=\"Force Techniques\">Force Techniques</a></i> </p><p>When you use the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vital_Transfer\" title=\"Vital Transfer\">Vital Transfer</a></i> Force Power, if your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check equals or exceeds the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> DC of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disease\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disease\">Disease</a> currently ailing the target, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to cure that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disease\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disease\">Disease</a>. </p>",
